NOTE ON THE SCHOOL PROFILES

The school profiles, attribute values and cultural characterisations in
src/schools.js are interpretive opinion drawn from publicly available
information. They are not measurements, not assessments, and have not been
reviewed or endorsed by any school named. They are offered without warranty
of accuracy and must not be relied upon for any decision without independent
verification directly with the school concerned.
